{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "没人初始化",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 45.54,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2017 年 11 月，以太坊上发生了一件怪事。",
   "spoken": "2017 年 11 月，以太坊上发生了一件怪事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 5.506
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "有个用户，调用了一个库合约的初始化函数。",
   "spoken": "有个用户，掉用了一个库合约的初始化函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 5.9,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 5.997,
   "speechEnd": 9.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "这个库，是 Parity 多签钱包共用的代码。",
   "spoken": "这个库，是 Parity 多签钱包共用的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 9.64,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 9.738,
   "speechEnd": 12.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "部署之后，从来没有人初始化过它。",
   "spoken": "部署之后，从来没有人初始化过它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 13.06,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 13.157,
   "speechEnd": 16.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "于是，他成了这个库的 owner。",
   "spoken": "于是，他成了这个库的 owner。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 16.48,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 16.571,
   "speechEnd": 18.439
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "接着，他调用了 kill，把库合约销毁了。",
   "spoken": "接着，他掉用了 kill，把库合约销毁了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 18.86,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 18.86,
   "speechEnd": 22.091
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "依赖这个库的钱包，一下子失去了代码逻辑。",
   "spoken": "依赖这个库的钱包，一下子失去了代码逻辑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 22.52,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 22.61,
   "speechEnd": 25.748
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "约 51 万 ETH，就此冻结。",
   "spoken": "约 51 万 ETH，就此冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 26.18,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 26.18,
   "speechEnd": 28.783
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "他没有破解任何密码，也没有偷任何私钥。",
   "spoken": "他没有破解任何密码，也没有偷任何私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 29.2,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 29.2,
   "speechEnd": 33.177
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "他只是调用了一个，没有权限检查的函数。",
   "spoken": "他只是掉用了一个，没有权限检查的函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 33.58,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 33.58,
   "speechEnd": 36.82
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "这一集讲访问控制。",
   "spoken": "这一集讲访问控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep05/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 37.24,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 37.339,
   "speechEnd": 39.011
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "每个按钮背后，都有同一个问题：谁有权按它？",
   "spoken": "每个按钮背后，都有同一个问题：谁有权按它？",
